BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 590.00 Tm (Murph is a personal wellness, journaling, education, and self-experimentation tool. Murph is not a doctor,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 576.00 Tm (clinician, hospital, pharmacy, therapist, dietitian, trainer, emergency service, medical device, remote) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 562.00 Tm (patient monitoring service, or clinical decision support system.) Tj ET
