BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 530.00 Tm (judgment. Do not use Murph to diagnose, treat, cure, prevent, monitor, or alleviate any disease, injury,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 516.00 Tm (disability, or medical condition.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 488.00 Tm (2. AI output can be wrong) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 464.00 Tm (Murph output may be inaccurate, incomplete, biased, stale, misleading, unsafe, or not applicable to your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 450.00 Tm (situation. Output may reflect errors in your inputs, wearable data, imported records, lab values, files,) Tj ET
