BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 404.00 Tm (supplements, treatment, diagnostic testing, medical devices, exercise, sauna, cold exposure, fasting,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 390.00 Tm (alcohol changes, sleep interventions, or other health-related activities.) Tj ET
