BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 338.00 Tm (Do not use Murph for emergencies, urgent care, crisis response, acute symptoms, medication) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 324.00 Tm (emergencies, overdose, poisoning, chest pain, difficulty breathing, fainting, severe allergic reactions,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 310.00 Tm (suicidal thoughts, self-harm, disordered-eating crises, or other time-sensitive clinical decisions.) Tj ET
