BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 278.00 Tm (immediate in-person care.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 250.00 Tm (4. No medication or clinical decision authority) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 226.00 Tm (Do not use Murph to determine whether to start, stop, change, time, increase, decrease, combine, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 212.00 Tm (dose any medication, supplement, therapy, treatment, diagnostic test, medical device, or clinical care) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 198.00 Tm (plan.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 180.00 Tm (Murph may not detect dangerous interactions, contraindications, allergies, adverse effects, abnormal) Tj ET
